</section><section data-mw-section-id="5" id="mwARM" aria-labelledby="Historical"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Historical">Historical</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Capital_of_Japan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5" title="Edit section: Historical"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwARQ">This list of capitals includes the Imperial palaces names in parentheses.</p>
