<li id="mwATs"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Asuka,_Yamato" title="Asuka, Yamato" id="mwATw">Asuka, Yamato</a> (Palace of <i id="mwAT0">Tohotsu</i>), reign of <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emperor_Ingyō" title="Emperor Ingyō" id="mwAT4">Emperor Ingyō</a><sup about="#mwt88" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-35" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-35"}}'><a href="#cite_note-35" id="mwAT8"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwAUA"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAUE">[</span>35<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwAUI">]</span></span></a></sup></li>
